    "detailed_description": "Galaxies around us are full of invaders and it is high time to clean them up. In Nebula you choose a hero, collect space junk to improve your level and gather as much gears (game currency) as possible to upgrade your player / weapon stats in the hangar. Do not be discouraged with failure, experiment with new builds to find the one that suits you best. You can come back stronger and show those space rogues who is a sheriff in this game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101250/extras/4d70dab1598fd175e542abee16a61520.poster.avif?t=1732296235\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101250/extras/4d70dab1598fd175e542abee16a61520.webm?t=1732296235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101250/extras/4d70dab1598fd175e542abee16a61520.mp4?t=1732296235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose your hero</h2>Choose one of 9 space ships, each with specific bonus and different main weapon.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101250/extras/48ef521accc9f4fd57b868a02bdfba66.poster.avif?t=1732296235\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101250/extras/48ef521accc9f4fd57b868a02bdfba66.webm?t=1732296235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101250/extras/48ef521accc9f4fd57b868a02bdfba66.mp4?t=1732296235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock new content</h2>Unlock new, stronger weapon and heroes to expand your fleet and arsenal. Game offers 4 hidden ships and 8 stronger version of a weapons to help you with your space adventure.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Spend your gears on new upgrades</h2>Visit the hangar to improve your equipment even further.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101250/extras/a8fa5c090b68b2903d56fa956558573b.poster.avif?t=1732296235\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101250/extras/a8fa5c090b68b2903d56fa956558573b.webm?t=1732296235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101250/extras/a8fa5c090b68b2903d56fa956558573b.mp4?t=1732296235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive your mission</h2>Pickup new weapons and power-ups to grow stronger. Activate resource hubs to get new buffs and more gears.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101250/extras/038f8bdebe03103add8d17191ce5512d.poster.avif?t=1732296235\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101250/extras/038f8bdebe03103add8d17191ce5512d.webm?t=1732296235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101250/extras/038f8bdebe03103add8d17191ce5512d.mp4?t=1732296235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Have fun!</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101250/extras/fa5dfe17600e372c2f376cea9013ddce.poster.avif?t=1732296235\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101250/extras/fa5dfe17600e372c2f376cea9013ddce.webm?t=1732296235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor